{"4833800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roots n Roofs", "steam_appid": 4833800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/853d76ebeb6bf5346dd1cb0cfcffeb2d.poster.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/853d76ebeb6bf5346dd1cb0cfcffeb2d.webm?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/853d76ebeb6bf5346dd1cb0cfcffeb2d.mp4?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roots n Roofs is a cozy sandbox about building fairy gardens and decorating your charming little world with stump houses, mossy paths, flowers, and mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/c61d0069e566c3685d9b023441024351.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/562d54c63ccd76f74e28397fc3c33616.poster.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/562d54c63ccd76f74e28397fc3c33616.webm?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/562d54c63ccd76f74e28397fc3c33616.mp4?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft flowing, organic structures in a voxel-based builder where roughness and imperfections become part of a natural beauty that feels magical and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/f6e677247b4073094fda60dca72b523d.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/baf9f75c7f2c13b981e5c7f1b69ad6d2.poster.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/baf9f75c7f2c13b981e5c7f1b69ad6d2.webm?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/baf9f75c7f2c13b981e5c7f1b69ad6d2.mp4?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a forest glade into a little living village, whimsical castle, or something truly unique that reflects your imagination. Build at your own pace, no pressure - just a calm place to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/9f16ac8188cd56a85600411e12bef0c6.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/e61eb147aa77b29097711d460022e022.poster.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/e61eb147aa77b29097711d460022e022.webm?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/e61eb147aa77b29097711d460022e022.mp4?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A serene environment surrounds you with songbirds, buzzing insects, sleepy snails, and wandering chestnuts, filling the world with warmth and curiosity.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/853d76ebeb6bf5346dd1cb0cfcffeb2d.poster.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/853d76ebeb6bf5346dd1cb0cfcffeb2d.webm?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/853d76ebeb6bf5346dd1cb0cfcffeb2d.mp4?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roots n Roofs is a cozy sandbox about building fairy gardens and decorating your charming little world with stump houses, mossy paths, flowers, and mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/c61d0069e566c3685d9b023441024351.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/562d54c63ccd76f74e28397fc3c33616.poster.avif?t=1787459144\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833800/extras/562d54c63ccd76f74e28397fc3c33616.webm?t=1787459144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour